o such things anyway.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/5422331770497621087'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/5422331770497621087'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html?showComment=1426630119801#c5422331770497621087' title=''/><author><name>Kent McManigal</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05005964583189815410</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-XDS5j4fY-sM/Tt5wgUmUlxI/AAAAAAAAAUI/ZgGJCCjqSPg/s220/Me%2B11-23-2011a.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1439296678702653951' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1439296678702653951' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1703325864"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 17, 2015 at 4:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6906573930052891969</id><published>2015-03-15T21:41:06.518-06:00</published><updated>2015-03-15T21:41:06.518-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for pointing all this out. I would add that...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for pointing all this out. I would add that much of this propaganda aimed at painting &amp;quot;constitutionalists&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;sovereign citizens&amp;quot; as &amp;quot;low-level terror threats&amp;quot; along and lumping them in with the KKK, is furiously put out by the SPLC. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There was recently an Investigation Discovery channel show on &amp;quot;hate in America&amp;quot; which regurgitated this statement that there&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;900 hate groups&amp;quot; in this country. It didn&amp;#39;t say these &amp;quot;hate groups&amp;quot; include peaceful protesters be they anti-abortion or anti-corruption &amp;quot;sovereign citizens&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The point is that this is a STEREOTYPE. Characterizing an entire group as &amp;quot;anti-government&amp;quot; because of one guy hanging out then flipping out, is like saying that all the millions of black people in the country are liquor store robbing gang members because one black guy robbed a liquor store or a bunch of clowns raided one in Ferguson.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Furthermore, it&amp;#39;s blatantly obvious that those perpetuating that stereotype do so because they are either cowards that shouldn&amp;#39;t have a dangerous job like law enforcement, or they are criminals. You have to, to be calling citizens opposed to corruption in government and law enforcement &amp;quot;anti-government&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;anti-law enforcement&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Newsflash: Those &amp;quot;anti-government radicals&amp;quot; would LOVE to have a LEGITIMATE government and LEGITIMATE police that arrest and charge and convict the criminals that arrested Antonio Buehler for recording their crimes.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/6906573930052891969'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/6906573930052891969'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html?showComment=1426477266518#c6906573930052891969' title=''/><author><name>E-Man</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12255599282585791162</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1439296678702653951' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1439296678702653951' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-458826076"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 15, 2015 at 9:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4117309647992455902</id><published>2015-03-03T21:23:17.774-07:00</published><updated>2015-03-03T21:23:17.774-07:00</updated><title type='text'>10-4</title><content type='html'>10-4</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/4117309647992455902'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/4117309647992455902'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html?showComment=1425442997774#c4117309647992455902' title=''/><author><name>Mr. Mcgranor</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12851136550476241757</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-fvz944a_UKA/UKW-6IDm5tI/AAAAAAAAAJM/nsVzSTpLxvQ/s1600/150_964816-0.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1439296678702653951' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1439296678702653951' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1659259730"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 3, 2015 at 9:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2565882667975715872</id><published>2015-03-01T07:16:24.310-07:00</published><updated>2015-03-01T07:16:24.310-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The two post Donna and the one below it from Anony...</title><content type='html'>The two post Donna and the one below it from Anonymous, are both making the point as Will is. We have lost our country to government employees, aka: Parasites. The whole thing of government is a safe haven for losers who can not make it in the private sector. Once in government they hide behind the authority of the law and cheat through any scam they can dream up to steal property from the taxpayers. These people in government come at the citizens from all angles, fed, state, county and city and from many departments in each one of the government levels. There&amp;#39;s a lot of government mouths and their dependents to feed and they could care less if you and yours go hungry and are cold turning down the heat to pay more of their fees and taxes. There is no conspiracy here, its just flat out greed from parasites in government backed up by the laws that they made. You can&amp;#39;t make this stuff up. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/2565882667975715872'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/2565882667975715872'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html?showComment=1425219384310#c2565882667975715872' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1439296678702653951' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1439296678702653951' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1470064279"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2015 at 7:16 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-939898357537554395</id><published>2015-02-28T21:18:01.841-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-28T21:18:01.841-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Donna from North Dakota..., your description is ve...</title><content type='html'>Donna from North Dakota..., your description is very much like the yearly rental property inspections they do in my city.&lt;br /&gt;You have no choice but to let them in - IF - you want to continue renting. They threaten to revoke the ability of the landlord to rent the property if you fail to submit and obey. The city inspectors walked through every single room of the house I was renting. I asked them to remove their shoes before they came in and they refused saying, &amp;#39;There might be needles in there!&amp;#39;&lt;br /&gt;Oh boy, they walk through places with needles on the floor and want to track stuff into where I lived, and they see nothing wrong with that either.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/939898357537554395'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/939898357537554395'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html?showComment=1425183481841#c939898357537554395' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1439296678702653951' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1439296678702653951' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-660257654"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 28, 2015 at 9:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1510256023023984855</id><published>2015-02-28T19:01:46.162-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-28T19:01:46.162-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Donna from North Dakota...&#xa;&#xa;What are the consequen...</title><content type='html'>Donna from North Dakota...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What are the consequences of refusing to allow a city/county property tax assessor entry into one&amp;#39;s home for an &amp;#39;Interior Inspection&amp;#39;?  &amp;#39;Interior Inspections&amp;#39; are increasingly employed by property tax collection entities to determine what &amp;#39;updates&amp;#39; the Sovereign might be hiding. I am now labeled &amp;#39;militant&amp;#39; for questioning - at a public meeting - this outrageous intrusion . It was also suggested that I must be guilty of something criminal based upon my resistance to allowing a perfect stranger &amp;#39;in authority&amp;#39; to wander through my home. By refusing &amp;#39;interior inspection&amp;#39;, the tax assessor will value my property at the highest possible valuation with NO &amp;#39;right to appeal&amp;#39;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/1510256023023984855'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/1510256023023984855'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html?showComment=1425175306162#c1510256023023984855' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1439296678702653951' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1439296678702653951' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1806229807"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 28, 2015 at 7:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1160721127517473622</id><published>2015-02-28T12:50:10.425-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-28T12:50:10.425-07:00</updated><title type='text'>There&amp;#39;s nothing I can add to the astute declam...</title><content type='html'>There&amp;#39;s nothing I can add to the astute declamations present in this &amp;quot;must read&amp;quot; masterpiece.  It strikes fear in the heart of every true God-child, to study this.  You are exactly correct verbatim in your descriptions.  Carry on with Gods&amp;#39; Grace. Will send some cash shortly.  Better you are flush than me.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/1160721127517473622'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/1160721127517473622'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sov