ogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1439296678702653951' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1439296678702653951' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-706577844"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2015 at 11:59 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3826350466649895392</id><published>2015-02-27T10:55:45.330-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-27T10:55:45.330-07:00</updated><title type='text'>the title states it all.&#xa;&#xa;it is difficult to belie...</title><content type='html'>the title states it all.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;it is difficult to believe that at one time we were the former as one looks at the present with far too many of us having accepted being the latter.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;it is the acceptance of the latter label in the title of your article that explains much in this society today.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/3826350466649895392'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1439296678702653951/comments/default/3826350466649895392'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/if-youre-not-sovereign-youre-servile.html?showComment=1425059745330#c3826350466649895392' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns